================================================================================
Runtime dependencies
================================================================================

Python dependencies are declared in gateway/pyproject.toml and
indexer/pyproject.toml and are installed rather than vendored. The container
images additionally include Debian packages (ca-certificates, git, tini, curl)
under their respective licences.

The Compose stack references Keycloak (Apache-2.0), LiteLLM (MIT) and Ollama
(MIT) as separate services. They are not redistributed by repo-mcp.
